---
title: Garlic Rice and Chicken
servings: 2
cuisine: american
main_protein: chicken
prep_time: "15 minutes"
cook_time: "25 minutes"
tags:
  - dinner
  - chicken
  - rice
  - garlic
image: ../obsidian/attachments/Pasted image 20250804193129.png
prep:
  - Defrost the chicken
  - Slice the chicken horizontally into thin slices
  - Mix the spices
  - Mince 2 tsp garlic
---
Defrost the @boneless skinless chicken breasts{1%lb}.

Slice the chicken horizontally into thin slices.

Toss in spices (@paprika{1%tsp}, @smoked paprika{0.25%tsp}, @garlic powder{0.5%tsp}, @onion powder{0.5%tsp}, @salt{0.75%tsp}, @brown sugar{1.5%tsp}, @cornstarch{1%tsp} or flour) and @avocado oil{2%tsp}.

Lay pieces in #air fryer{} and cook for ~{10%minutes} at 420 degrees.

For the rice, cook @jasmine rice{1%cup} in @chicken broth{1.5%cups} with @garlic{2%tsp}, minced, @salted butter{2%tbsp}, cut in half pieces, and @kosher salt{0.5%tsp}.

-- Garlic rice and sweet chicken breast.
-- Our thoughts: really juicy chicken with some nice crispy parts; good tasting rice.
